{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e202d98bf60ca4a5a295cb881f79098783f9115d79634f04b0712bf69072d948", "ja": "（ツアーで、ベトナムとカンボジアを回っている。\nライブ前日、恵美と街へ繰り出しているのだが……）", "zh": "（巡演期间正在游历越南和柬埔寨。演出前一天，正和惠美一起逛街，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "fb49c0ea89bb3355497fda97b45c3c26a532e553d1f1fb1bd91bf93488392234", "ja": "ゴメ～ン、{$P$}！　気になるお店が\n色々あって、ついブラブラしちゃってたよ～。", "zh": "抱歉——，{$P$}！有好多让我感兴趣的店，一不小心就逛起来了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1002_p", "source_sha256": "aa51eae865608e04373bc191e7b5ee0ed11bdb7567c3c9020964d8ae901fa883", "ja": "あっ、恵美！　よ、よかった……。\nいきなりいなくなって心配したんだぞ？", "zh": "啊，惠美！太、太好了……\n你突然不见了，我很担心你啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "a5cba75422544acbda837448a746441cbb6318789b6ac9a86dbbc29a1a32abba", "ja": "にゃはは、ごめんごめん♪　けど、無事こうして\n再会できたんだし、問題なしってことで！", "zh": "呀哈哈，抱歉抱歉♪不过，既然我们平安无事地重逢了，就当作没问题啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f1680cb2d793daa595b68b8891b34a47f2aa730ed562a0f140aeb6d99b4014a7", "ja": "やれやれ……。\nしかし、今日は朝からテンションが高いな？", "zh": "真拿你没办法……\n不过，你今天一大早就情绪很高涨呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "dd5ead9eaddf84834ff37fd53966237e488f09cbf4620ed1df1fce0c4c0c4209", "ja": "そりゃもちろん！　なんたって海外に来てるんだし……\nなによりこの街が、すごくいい場所じゃない？", "zh": "那当然啦！毕竟我们现在可是在国外嘛……更重要的是，这座城市不是特别棒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "9c1cd5ef925dc43e4cc38c599d239fc78d49da2e96b89e45f7f036a2fa2fcbe8", "ja": "アオザイも可愛かったし、ご飯も美味しいもの\nばっかりだし……テンション上がりまくりだよ～♪", "zh": "奥黛也很可爱，而且这里的饭菜全都好好吃……整个人都兴奋起来了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1007_p", "source_sha256": "548a6daf7753f10167f1277ba8bf7169be72c0a9c14df14fc088cd47304209f3", "ja": "はは、すっかり旅行気分だな。忘れてないとは思うけど\n大事なのはライブを成功させることで……。", "zh": "哈哈，已经完全进入旅行模式了啊。我想你应该没忘，不过最重要的还是要让演唱会成功……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "c27b6cf27993500af9e9493efa4de5bffd1e82e8c6a75e3747248179787d0639", "ja": "あはは、だいじょーぶ！　この街に、\nたっくさん元気をもらったからね。", "zh": "啊哈哈，没问题～的！毕竟我从\n这座城市里，得到了超～多活力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "1ecabebee8ee33293fdf8eba5891e8fe0365a6d33b48e919163bc7546c86bab2", "ja": "明日はお礼も込めて……。アタシがみんなを\n元気にするんだから！　気合い入れていくよ～！", "zh": "明天也要好好道谢……我一定要让大家打起精神来！拿出干劲上吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1b461ece8643419cb63ed06f6c4e4d5e321987c785e8e736c28b145571e5c874", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。さて……それじゃ\nホテルに戻る前に軽くご飯でも食べようか。", "zh": "啊，是啊。那么……回酒店之前，先随便吃点东西吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "c1b4b1efe58ec3c633173fbbbee8c315d2f825fa7180fa52cd6e020af4cef74c", "ja": "賛成！　アタシ、もうお腹ペコペコだよ～！\nうーん、何食べよっかな～……。", "zh": "赞成！我已经饿得肚子咕咕叫了～！嗯——吃什么好呢～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a84ac70586fca0ffbadde5ca829510cfb8efe36dd256be6cb96ba8397c9f079c", "ja": "ちょっとスマホで調べてみようか。\nオススメのお店も載ってるだろうし……。", "zh": "要不先用手机查一下吧。\n上面应该也会有推荐的店……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "523be906b00c6496c88cdc874176c625569fe2c0f6ec8d4b83f947c0c2190bcb", "ja": "もー。ダメだよ{$P$}！　こういう\nのは、その場のノリで入るのが楽しいんだから！", "zh": "真是的。不行啦{$P$}！这种\n事情，顺着当时的气氛随便进才好玩嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "667e9eaddbe2810c7eea167b32acf3f3795af9a029104ff92bc868363e861864", "ja": "それにどこも美味しそうなお店ばっかりだし、\nふたりで色々回って、相談しながら決めよ！", "zh": "而且到处都是看起来很好吃的店，咱们一起逛逛，边商量边决定吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cf74be2d3d7e248dca6495ba31ea81bfbba725b5ad1c34bcae348495526ab37f", "ja": "確かに。恵美の言う通りだな。\nよし、それじゃ一緒に街をまわってみようか。", "zh": "说得对，恵美说得没错。\n好，那我们一起逛逛街吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0533_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "32cfd829e6a13bee8d860fa5b42b20f68abe0c77bf18c978da4f557eff54c078", "ja": "うん♪　せっかくだから、シェアしながら食べようね！\nその方が、いっぱいお店も回れるし。にゃはは♪", "zh": "嗯♪ 难得来一次，我们分着吃吧！\n这样还能多逛几家店呢。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
